WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:05.279
to access your Microsoft Office programs

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:10.139
on a Mac there are three ways you can do

00:00:05.279 --> 00:00:13.259
this the first way is you can select the

00:00:10.139 --> 00:00:15.960
finder and from there select

00:00:13.259 --> 00:00:18.750
applications and then you can scroll

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:22.859
down to find the relevant program so

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:26.220
Word PowerPoint or Excel alternatively

00:00:22.859 --> 00:00:28.830
you can do your launchpad and on the

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:31.650
launchpad screen you can then navigate

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:38.670
to where the program icon saw which is

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:42.750
Excel PowerPoint and Word and finally

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:45.870
you can attach the shortcuts to the

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:47.910
programs on your toolbar at the bottom

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:51.420
of the screen as you can see at least

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:54.449
Word Excel and PowerPoint on this bar

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:58.129
for easy access which will then

00:00:54.449 --> 00:00:58.129
automatically launch the programs